OL,3,GNEWSATherapy dog among Make a
OL,4,ADifference Awards nominees
OL,5,
OL,6,FA therapy dog and a football team for
OL,7,Frefugees and asylum seekers are among
OL,8,Fthe finalists for an award ceremony
OL,9,Fcelebrating local heroes.
OL,11,FThe BBC Radio Oxford Make a Difference
OL,12,FAwards has eight categories,
OL,13,Frecognising those who love to make life
OL,14,Fbetter for others in the county.
OL,16,FTo date, millions of people have been
OL,17,Finvolved in Make a Difference across
OL,18,FBBC radio stations.
